+         row  `BadPublicKey`  2  _the public key was not a SubjectPublicKeyInfo_  i byte di una chiave non sono un `SubjectPublicKeyInfo`

-         row  `BadSerialNumber`  3  _the serial number was negative or zero_
+         row  `BadSerialNumber`  3  _the serial number was negative or zero_

-         row  `BadValidity`  4  _the validity period ended before it began_  a period which ends at or before its start
+         row  `BadValidity`  4  _the validity period ended before it began_  un periodo che finisce prima del proprio inizio o nello stesso istante

